Subject: [PATCH] 9772: fix(dwarf): Recover register and frame-relative
 variable locations

fix(dwarf): Recover register and stack locations.

- Preserve terminal register locations and resolve register-valued frame bases without duplicating expression results.
- Recover stack-relative register values using bounded straight-line symbolic evaluation at valid location PCs.
- Add regression coverage for stack frames, entry ranges, frame-base validity, and wildcard cache isolation.
- Fixes #9771.
